HAVING:
-having clause used only with the groupby clause,if i dont have groupby clause in my query then dont use having clause it will throw error.
-Where condition is always executed(ordered) before the groupby clause.
-if i want to apply any conditions after "groupby" we must used "having" clause.
eg:select continent,count(*) as no_of_Country from population group by continent having count(*)>1 --note:here count(*) is nothing but no_of_countries column
eg: select continent,count(*) as no_of_Country from population group by continent having sum(total_population)>6000000 AND COUNT(*)>3; --here we can use two having conditions after groupby
