Advanced Subqueries- subquery is a query whihc is contained inside another query(main query)
if its difficult to achive result using one query we use subquery
in Select stmt i can refer to a subquery in select clause, from, where, having,
-subquery is the one whihc is first executed
-main query takes the output from the subquery as its input
eg:query1:calculate avgvale of total population from table
select avg(total_pop)from population --ans:463892020
(main)query2:find the countries with population higher than the avgvalue thats calculated in step1 --here it takes output of step1(subquery)
select country from population where total_pop >463892020
-SCALAR SUBQUERY
subquery:(scalar sub queries where sub query returns only one value)
1.select country from population where total_pop > (select avg(total_pop)from population )
2.select country from population where total_pop = (select max(total_pop)from population )
